<title>USA: IPO PRICING- Concentric in range at $12.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING- Concentric in range at $12.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	  Concentric Network Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $12</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $10 - $12</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			4,300,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		 UBS Securities</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public  offering in Concentric Network Corp was raised to 4.3 million shares  from 3.6 million shares previously. Initially, the filing proposed  to offer three million shares.</p>
</text>
